      "html": "<body>\r\n<cb:mulu level=\"1\" n=\"27\" type=\"會\">27 善順菩薩會</cb:mulu>\r\n<milestone n=\"96\" unit=\"juan\"/>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0540a20\">0540a20</span>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0540a21\">0540a21</span><cb:div type=\"hui\">\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0540a22\">0540a22</span><cb:juan n=\"096\" fun=\"open\"><cb:mulu n=\"096\" type=\"卷\"></cb:mulu><cb:jhead><title>大寶積經</title>卷<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0540001\">〔第〕－【聖】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0540001\">第【大】，〔－〕【聖】</span><app n=\"0540001\"><p class=\"lg\">第</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【聖】\"><space quantity=\"0\"/></rdg></app>九十六</cb:jhead></cb:juan>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0540a23\">0540a23</span>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0540a24\">0540a24</span><byline cb:type=\"Translator\"><anchor xml:id=\"fxT11p0540a01\"/>大唐三藏<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0540002\">〔法師〕－【聖】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0540002\">法師【大】，〔－〕【聖】</span><app n=\"0540002\"><p class=\"lg\">法師</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【聖】\"><space quantity=\"0\"/></rdg></app>菩提流志奉　<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0540003\">詔＝誥【聖】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0540003\">詔【大】，誥【聖】</span><app n=\"0540003\"><p class=\"lg\">詔</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【聖】\">誥</rdg></app>譯</byline>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0540a25\">0540a25</span><cb:mulu level=\"1\" n=\"28\" type=\"會\">28 勤授長者會</cb:mulu><head>勤授長者會第二十八</head>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0540a26\">0540a26</span><p>如是我聞：</p><p>一時佛在舍衛國祇樹給孤獨園，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0540a27\">0540a27</span>與大比丘眾千二百五十人俱，皆是阿羅漢，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0540a28\">0540a28</span>諸漏已盡，無復煩惱得上調伏，猶如大龍，所\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0540a29\">0540a29</span>作已辦，棄諸重擔，逮得己利，盡諸有結。正\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0540b01\">0540b01</span>智解脫心得自在，最上應供，眾所知識。唯\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0540b02\">0540b02</span>有阿難，猶在學地。其名曰：阿若憍陳如、摩\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0540b03\">0540b03</span>訶迦葉、摩訶迦旃延、摩訶阿濕波、舍利弗、\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0540b04\">0540b04</span>大目乾連、摩訶劫賓那、摩訶拘絺羅、摩訶\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0540b05\">0540b05</span>梵頗、羅睺羅、難陀，如是等而為上首。復有\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0540b06\">0540b06</span>菩薩摩訶薩五百人俱，皆得三昧及陀羅尼。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0540b07\">0540b07</span><p>爾時舍衛大城有一長者名勇猛授，富有\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0540b08\">0540b08</span>財寶倉庫盈溢，金銀琉璃、車<g ref=\"#CB00006\"/>馬碯、珊瑚虎\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0540b09\">0540b09</span>珀、摩尼真珠、象馬牛羊、奴婢僕使商估等類，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0540b10\">0540b10</span>一切眾多。時勇猛授與五百長者遊讌聚\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0540b11\">0540b11</span>會，作是議言：「諸仁者！佛出世難，人身難得，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0540b12\">0540b12</span>時亦難遇，於佛法中以信出家是事亦難，成\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0540b13\">0540b13</span>比丘性亦復甚難，如法修行是亦為難，知恩\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0540b14\">0540b14</span>報恩少恩不忘是人難得，能於佛法生信樂\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0540b15\">0540b15</span>心是人難得，信樂成就是事復難，莊嚴佛法\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0540b16\">0540b16</span>是事亦難，解脫生死倍復為難。我等為於聲\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0540b17\">0540b17</span>聞辟支佛乘而求滅度，為當發趣最上佛乘。」\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0540b18\">0540b18</span>咸復唱言：「我等寧於無上佛道而趣涅槃。」作\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0540b19\">0540b19</span>是議已，前後圍遶出舍衛城向祇陀林，詣\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0540b20\">0540b20</span>如來所頂禮佛足，右遶三匝却坐一面。</p><p>爾時\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0540b21\">0540b21</span>世尊知而故問，告長者言：「汝等何緣今來\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0540b22\">0540b22</span>我所？」</p><p>時勇猛授與五百長者從座而起，偏\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0540b23\">0540b23</span>袒右肩右膝著地，合掌向佛白言：「世尊！我\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0540b24\">0540b24</span>等諸人同時集會作是議言：『佛世難遇，人\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0540b25\">0540b25</span>身難得，乃至解脫生死倍復為難。我等為於\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0540b26\">0540b26</span>聲聞辟支佛乘而求滅度，為當發趣最上佛\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0540b27\">0540b27</span>乘。』咸作是言：『我等寧於無上佛道而趣涅槃。』\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0540b28\">0540b28</span>由此議故，今詣如來、應、正等覺。世尊！菩薩\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0540b29\">0540b29</span>摩訶薩志求阿耨多羅三藐三菩提者，應云\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0540c01\">0540c01</span>何學？應云何住？云何修行？」</p><p>佛言：「善哉善哉！\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0540c02\">0540c02</span>汝等發趣阿耨多羅三藐三菩提，來詣我所。\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0540c03\">0540c03</span>應當諦聽，善思念之。如諸菩薩應學、應住、應\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0540c04\">0540c04</span>所修行，當為汝說。」時諸長者受教而聽。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0540c05\">0540c05</span><p>佛告長者：「菩薩摩訶薩於阿耨多羅三藐三\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0540c06\">0540c06</span>菩提勝志樂者，當於一切眾生起大悲心，應\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0540c07\">0540c07</span>廣修行，應勤熏習。是故菩薩於身命財及\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0540c08\">0540c08</span>以妻子、倉庫舍宅、飲食衣服、車乘臥具、花鬘塗\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0540c09\">0540c09</span>香、一切樂具，應無所著。何以故？以諸眾生執\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0540c10\">0540c10</span>著於身而生惡業，由惡業故墮地獄中。若\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0540c11\">0540c11</span>於眾生起大悲心，於身命財則不執著，便生\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0540c12\">0540c12</span>善趣。是故菩薩摩訶薩於阿耨多羅三藐三\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0540c13\">0540c13</span>菩提勝志樂者，於諸眾生起慈悲已，應修\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0540c14\">0540c14</span>大捨而不求報，不求報者應住戒律，三戒清\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0540c15\">0540c15</span>淨應具忍辱，能忍諸惡應起精進不惜身命，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0540c16\">0540c16</span>應修一心安住禪定，應修智慧善巧方便，應\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0540c17\">0540c17</span>於我人眾生壽命皆悉捨離。為眾生故，應行\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0540c18\">0540c18</span>布施護持淨戒。為眾生故，應修忍辱發起精\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0540c19\">0540c19</span>進。為眾生故，應入禪定修習智慧善巧方便。」</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0540c20\">0540c20</span><p>時諸長者復白佛言：「世尊！我等於身及彼\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0540c21\">0540c21</span>妻子一切財寶資生之具，心常愛惜。世尊！菩\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0540c22\">0540c22</span>薩摩訶薩云何觀察，於身命<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0540004\">財＝不【明】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0540004\">財【大】，不【明】</span><app n=\"0540004\"><p class=\"lg\">財</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【明】\">不</rdg></app>能無貪悋？」</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0540c23\">0540c23</span><p>爾時世尊告長者言：「善男子！菩薩摩訶薩\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0540c24\">0540c24</span>於阿耨多羅三藐三菩提勝志樂者，應觀此\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0540c25\">0540c25</span>身無量過患，微塵積集生住異滅，念念遷流\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0540c26\">0540c26</span>九漏瘡門，猶如毒蛇所住窟穴，其中無主如\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0540c27\">0540c27</span>空聚落，畢竟破壞如坏瓦瓶，惡露盈溢猶如\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0540c28\">0540c28</span>穢器，受諸不淨猶如圊廁，不可觸動猶如惡\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0540c29\">0540c29</span>瘡，貪美為患如雜毒食，不識恩德如未生怨，\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0541a01\">0541a01</span>欺誤於人如惡知識，癡愛為害如友獼猴，斷\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0541a02\">0541a02</span>智慧命猶如殺者，奪諸善法猶如劫賊，常求\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0541a03\">0541a03</span>人便猶如怨讎，無有慈心猶如魁膾，難可承\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0541a04\">0541a04</span>事如暴惡人，如箭著身觸之則痛，如朽腐舍\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0541a05\">0541a05</span>常務修治，如老弱乘難可駈策，如毒蛇篋不\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0541a06\">0541a06</span>可附近，如<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0541001\">逆＝<g ref=\"#CB01618\"/>【宋】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0541001\">逆【大】，<g ref=\"#CB01618\"/>【宋】</span><app n=\"0541001\"><p class=\"lg\">逆</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】\"><g ref=\"#CB01618\"/></rdg></app>旅館疲苦所集，如孤獨舍無\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0541a07\">0541a07</span>所攝屬，如獄卒<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0541002\">伺＝司【三】【宮】【聖】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0541002\">伺【大】，司【宋】【元】【明】【宮】【聖】</span><app n=\"0541002\"><p class=\"lg\">伺</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】 【宮】 【聖】\">司</rdg></app>害，如王者憂國，如邊城\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0541a08\">0541a08</span>警畏，如惡國多災，如破器難持，如祠火無\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0541a09\">0541a09</span>厭，如陽焰虛誑，如幻化惑人，如析芭蕉中\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0541a10\">0541a10</span>無堅實，如水聚沫不可執持，如水上泡速起\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0541a11\">0541a11</span>速滅，如河岸樹臨危動搖，如<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0541003\">駛＝駚【宋】【元】【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0541003\">駛【大】，駚【宋】【元】【宮】</span><app n=\"0541003\"><p class=\"lg\">駛</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【宮】\">駚</rdg></app>河流終歸\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0541a12\">0541a12</span>死海。」</p><p>復告長者：「次觀此身前後因緣，初從\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0541a13\">0541a13</span>欲愛和合而生，為長養故咽於<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0541a1301\">摶【CB】，搏【大】</span><app n=\"0541a1301\"><p class=\"lg\">摶<note type=\"cf1\">T54n2128_p0425a09</note><note type=\"cf2\">X16n0318_p0889c08</note></lem><rdg wit=\"【大】\">搏</rdg></app>食，至於生\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0541a14\">0541a14</span>藏痰<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0541004\">陰＝蔭【元】【明】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0541004\">陰【大】，蔭【元】【明】</span><app n=\"0541004\"><p class=\"lg\">陰</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【元】 【明】\">蔭</rdg></app>消之。次至黃藏將欲熟時，則變為\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0541a15\">0541a15</span>酢。次至風藏風分汁滓，各別流行成大小便，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0541a16\">0541a16</span>汁變為血、血變為肉，肉處生<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0541005\">脂脂＝指指【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0541005\">脂脂【大】，指指【宮】</span><app n=\"0541005\"><p class=\"lg\">脂、脂</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宮】\">指指</rdg></app>處為骨、\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0541a17\">0541a17</span>骨中生髓，如是身緣前後不淨。若諸菩薩作\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0541a18\">0541a18</span>是觀時，復應思惟，如此身者三百六十骨聚\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0541a19\">0541a19</span>所成，如朽壞舍。諸節支持，以四<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0541006\">細＝網【三】【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0541006\">細【大】，網【宋】【元】【明】【宮】</span><app n=\"0541006\"><p class=\"lg\">細</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】 【宮】\">網</rdg></app>脈周匝\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0541a20\">0541a20</span>彌布，五百分肉猶若泥塗，六脈相繫、五百\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0541a21\">0541a21</span>筋纏、七百細脈以為編絡，十六麁脈鉤帶\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0541a22\">0541a22</span>相連，有二肉繩長三尋半於內纏結，十六\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0541a23\">0541a23</span>腸胃繞生熟藏，二十五氣脈猶如窓隙，一百\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0541a24\">0541a24</span>七關穴如破碎器，八萬毛孔如亂草覆，五根\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0541a25\">0541a25</span>七竅不淨盈滿，七重皮裹六味長養，猶如祠\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0541a26\">0541a26</span>火吞受無厭。如是之身，一切臭穢自性<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0541007\">潰＝殨【三】【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0541007\">潰【大】，殨【宋】【元】【明】【宮】</span><app n=\"0541007\"><p class=\"lg\">潰</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】 【宮】\">殨</rdg></app>爛，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0541a27\">0541a27</span>誰當於此愛重憍慢？唯應觀察，如借他器、猶\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0541a28\">0541a28</span>車運載、但為養育，至菩提故。」</p><p>爾時世尊而\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0541a29\">0541a29</span>說偈言：</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0541b01\">0541b01</span><p class=\"lg\"><p class=\"lg\">「是身眾穢器，<caesura/>猶如貯糞瓶，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0541b02\">0541b02</span><p class=\"lg\">凡夫無智慧，<caesura/>恃色生憍慢。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0541b03\">0541b03</span><p class=\"lg\">鼻中洟恒流，<caesura/>口氣常臭穢，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0541b04\">0541b04</span><p class=\"lg\">眼眵蟲遍身，<caesura/>誰當生淨想？</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0541b05\">0541b05</span><p class=\"lg\">如人執持炭，<caesura/>磨<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0541008\">瑩＝鎣【三】【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0541008\">瑩【大】，鎣【宋】【元】【明】【宮】</span><app n=\"0541008\"><p class=\"lg\">瑩</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】 【宮】\">鎣</rdg></app>欲令白，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0541b06\">0541b06</span><p class=\"lg\">假使至盡時，<caesura/>體色終無變。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0541b07\">0541b07</span><p class=\"lg\">設欲淨其身，<caesura/>傾河以自洗，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0541b08\">0541b08</span><p class=\"lg\">身盡莫能淨，<caesura/>其事亦如是。」</p></lg>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0541b09\">0541b09</span><p>於時世尊說此偈已，復告五百諸長者言：「若\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0541b10\">0541b10</span>諸菩薩發勝志樂趣於阿耨多羅三藐三菩\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0541b11\">0541b11</span>提者，應觀此身四十四種。何等名為四十四\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0541b12\">0541b12</span>種？一者此身可厭性無和合故，二者此身臭\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0541b13\">0541b13</span>穢膿血常流故，三者是身不堅畢竟敗壞故，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0541b14\">0541b14</span>四者是身羸弱支節相持故，五者是身不淨\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0541b15\">0541b15</span>穢惡流溢故，六者是身如幻誑惑凡愚故，七\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0541b16\">0541b16</span>者是身瘡門九處常流故，八者是身火然欲\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0541b17\">0541b17</span>火盛故，九者是身為火瞋火猛故，十者是身\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0541b18\">0541b18</span>遍然癡火遍故，十一者是身盲冥貪瞋癡故，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0541b19\">0541b19</span>十二者是身墮網愛網覆故，十三者是身瘡\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0541b20\">0541b20</span>聚瘡遍滿故，十四者是身不安四百四病故，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0541b21\">0541b21</span>十五者諸蟲住處八萬戶蟲故，十六者是身\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0541b22\">0541b22</span>無常畢竟歸死故，十七者是身頑癡於法無\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0541b23\">0541b23</span>知故，十八者猶如瓦器生住壞故，十九者是\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0541b24\">0541b24</span>身逼迫多憂惱故，二十者無有救護必壞滅\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0541b25\">0541b25</span>故，二十一者是身險惡諂誑難知故，二十二\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0541b26\">0541b26</span>者如無底坑諸欲難滿故，二十三者如火受\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0541b27\">0541b27</span>薪貪色無厭故，二十四者身無厭足貪受五\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0541b28\">0541b28</span>欲故，二十五者如被捶打隨損害故，二十六\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0541b29\">0541b29</span>者是身不定盛衰增減故，二十七者身隨心\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0541c01\">0541c01</span>轉不正思惟故，二十八者身不知恩必棄塚\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0541c02\">0541c02</span>間故，二十九者身為他食狐狼所噉故，三十\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0541c03\">0541c03</span>者身如機關筋骨相持故，三十一者身不可\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0541c04\">0541c04</span>觀膿血糞穢故，三十二者身不自由依飲食\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0541c05\">0541c05</span>生故，三十三者身妄纏裹終敗壞故，三十四\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0541c06\">0541c06</span>者身為惡友多逆害故，三十五者身為殺者\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0541c07\">0541c07</span>自殘害故，三十六者身為苦器苦所逼故，三\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0541c08\">0541c08</span>十七者身為苦聚五蘊生故，三十八者身為\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0541c09\">0541c09</span>無主眾緣生故，三十九者是身無命離男女\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0541c10\">0541c10</span>相故，四十者是身為空應觀蘊界處故，四十\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0541c11\">0541c11</span>一者是身虛妄如夢中故，四十二者是身不\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0541c12\">0541c12</span>實如幻化故，四十三者身為幻惑如陽焰故，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0541c13\">0541c13</span>四十四者身為欺誑如影像故。是為四十四\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0541c14\">0541c14</span>種。菩薩作是觀時，所有身命愛欲執著，妻子\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0541c15\">0541c15</span>舍宅飲食衣服、車乘香鬘一切樂具，皆悉厭\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0541c16\">0541c16</span>離無所顧戀，速能成就六波羅蜜疾得阿耨\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0541c17\">0541c17</span>多羅三藐三菩提。」</p><p>爾時世尊而說偈言：</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0541c18\">0541c18</span><p class=\"lg\"><p class=\"lg\">「善得人身甚為難，<caesura/>莫為此身造眾惡，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0541c19\">0541c19</span><p class=\"lg\">畢竟塚間餧狐狼，<caesura/>勿為惡見生貪愛。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0541c20\">0541c20</span><p class=\"lg\">凡愚迷惑癡狂故，<caesura/>由愛此身造諸業，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0541c21\">0541c21</span><p class=\"lg\">此身亦復不知恩，<caesura/>晝夜唯增眾苦緣。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0541c22\">0541c22</span><p class=\"lg\">機關動轉常疲困，<caesura/><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0541009\">洟＝涕【宮】【聖】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0541009\">洟【大】，涕【宮】【聖】</span><app n=\"0541009\"><p class=\"lg\">洟</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宮】 【聖】\">涕</rdg></app>唾便利恒充滿，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0541c23\">0541c23</span><p class=\"lg\">飢渴寒熱相煎迫，<caesura/>何有智者愛此身？</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0541c24\">0541c24</span><p class=\"lg\">此身無厭如大坑，<caesura/>徒能長養眾怨害，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0541c25\">0541c25</span><p class=\"lg\">由此身故常作惡，<caesura/>於無量劫受諸苦。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0541c26\">0541c26</span><p class=\"lg\">應念定死修勝福，<caesura/>正信生於佛法中，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0541c27\">0541c27</span><p class=\"lg\">飲食衣服及塗香，<caesura/>長養此身來已久。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0541c28\">0541c28</span><p class=\"lg\">誰能執持令不壞，<caesura/>應知無益勿耽迷，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0541c29\">0541c29</span><p class=\"lg\">牟尼世尊難可遇，<caesura/>無量劫中時出現。</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0542a01\">0542a01</span><p class=\"lg\">當於佛法生淨信。<caesura/>惡道可畏勿隨行，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0542a02\">0542a02</span><p class=\"lg\">設令壽命千億歲，<caesura/>猶懼無常生厭離，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0542a03\">0542a03</span><p class=\"lg\">何況須臾不可保，<caesura/>為彼沈淪惡趣中？</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0542a04\">0542a04</span><p class=\"lg\">或有惡友來相勸，<caesura/>人身難得今已得，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0542a05\">0542a05</span><p class=\"lg\">多求財寶受娛樂，<caesura/>及此盛年恣嬉遊。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0542a06\">0542a06</span><p class=\"lg\">何有求財而樂者？<caesura/>設得守護猶勤苦。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0542a07\">0542a07</span><p class=\"lg\">如此愚人徒妄言，<caesura/>是故智者應觀察。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0542a08\">0542a08</span><p class=\"lg\">財物如幻亦如夢，<caesura/>愚癡眾生被誑惑，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0542a09\">0542a09</span><p class=\"lg\">剎那時得剎那失，<caesura/>何有智者生愛心？</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0542a10\">0542a10</span><p class=\"lg\">譬如幻師幻化事，<caesura/>乾闥婆城種種色，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0542a11\">0542a11</span><p class=\"lg\">財寶如是誑凡愚，<caesura/>於虛妄中何有實？</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0542a12\">0542a12</span><p class=\"lg\">種種苦惱求財利，<caesura/>水火王賊常侵奪，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0542a13\">0542a13</span><p class=\"lg\">由此能為眾苦因，<caesura/>何有智者生愛樂？</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0542a14\">0542a14</span><p class=\"lg\">有諸常懷貪愛者，<caesura/>馳逐財利無厭時，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0542a15\">0542a15</span><p class=\"lg\">能於父母無慈心，<caesura/>乃至親屬生怨害。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0542a16\">0542a16</span><p class=\"lg\">言語善順心乖違，<caesura/>造作種種欺誑緣，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0542a17\">0542a17</span><p class=\"lg\">或學邪論邪呪等，<caesura/>誇衒<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0542001\">伎＝技【三】【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0542001\">伎【大】，技【宋】【元】【明】【宮】</span><app n=\"0542001\"><p class=\"lg\">伎</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】 【宮】\">技</rdg></app>藝如婬女。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0542a18\">0542a18</span><p class=\"lg\">或復諂誑現柔和，<caesura/>或復剛強示威猛，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0542a19\">0542a19</span><p class=\"lg\">如是無量眾惡業，<caesura/>莫不皆由財利生。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0542a20\">0542a20</span><p class=\"lg\">珊瑚金玉摩尼珠，<caesura/>是物本來如泡沫，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0542a21\">0542a21</span><p class=\"lg\">不能了知如幻化，<caesura/>為此虛誑墜三塗。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0542a22\">0542a22</span><p class=\"lg\">彌勒世尊出現時，<caesura/>一生次當補我處，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0542a23\">0542a23</span><p class=\"lg\">國界黃金而布地，<caesura/>是等為從何所來？</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0542a24\">0542a24</span><p class=\"lg\">劫盡世間悉燒壞，<caesura/>須彌河海盡燋枯，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0542a25\">0542a25</span><p class=\"lg\">畢竟磨滅歸虛空，<caesura/>而此寶物何從去？</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0542a26\">0542a26</span><p class=\"lg\">種種惡業求財物，<caesura/>養育妻子謂歡娛，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0542a27\">0542a27</span><p class=\"lg\">臨命終時苦逼身，<caesura/>妻子無能相救者。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0542a28\">0542a28</span><p class=\"lg\">於彼三塗怖畏中，<caesura/>不見妻子及親識，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0542a29\">0542a29</span><p class=\"lg\">車馬財寶屬他人，<caesura/>受苦誰能共分者？</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0542b01\">0542b01</span><p class=\"lg\">父母兄弟及妻子，<caesura/>朋友僮僕并珍財，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0542b02\">0542b02</span><p class=\"lg\">死去無一來相親，<caesura/>唯有黑業常隨逐。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0542b03\">0542b03</span><p class=\"lg\">智人終不為親愛，<caesura/>作諸惡業入阿鼻，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0542b04\">0542b04</span><p class=\"lg\">唯除業盡方得出，<caesura/>親屬無有能代者。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0542b05\">0542b05</span><p class=\"lg\">閻羅使者唯考業，<caesura/>不問親緣及友朋，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0542b06\">0542b06</span><p class=\"lg\">汝得人身不捨惡，<caesura/>極苦今應甘忍受。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0542b07\">0542b07</span><p class=\"lg\">閻羅常告彼罪人，<caesura/>無有少罪我能加，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0542b08\">0542b08</span><p class=\"lg\">汝自作罪今自來，<caesura/>業報自招無代者。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0542b09\">0542b09</span><p class=\"lg\">父母妻子無能救，<caesura/>唯當勤修出離因，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0542b10\">0542b10</span><p class=\"lg\">是故應捨枷鏁業，<caesura/>善知遠離求安樂，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0542b11\">0542b11</span><p class=\"lg\">於家妻子應生怖，<caesura/>恒依佛教正修行，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0542b12\">0542b12</span><p class=\"lg\">在家熾然為苦本，<caesura/>猶如炎鑪甚可畏。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0542b13\">0542b13</span><p class=\"lg\">身心燋熱鎮燒燃，<caesura/>誰有智者生貪著？</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0542b14\">0542b14</span><p class=\"lg\">愛樂修行諸佛教，<caesura/>無所營求為快樂。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0542b15\">0542b15</span><p class=\"lg\">愚闇凡夫不覺知，<caesura/>家為苦本橫貪愛，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0542b16\">0542b16</span><p class=\"lg\">於彼皮筋骨肉中，<caesura/>迷惑妄生夫婦想，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0542b17\">0542b17</span><p class=\"lg\">不能了知如幻化，<caesura/>凡夫於此生貪著。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0542b18\">0542b18</span><p class=\"lg\">智者能知此過患，<caesura/>世間欲樂皆捐棄，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0542b19\">0542b19</span><p class=\"lg\">樂法當如求藥想，<caesura/>應速捨離居家縛。」</p></lg>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0542b20\">0542b20</span><p>爾時五百長者聞此法已得無生忍，歡喜\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0542b21\">0542b21</span>踊躍而說偈言：</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0542b22\">0542b22</span><p class=\"lg\"><p class=\"lg\">「慶哉獲大利，<caesura/>諸利中最上，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0542b23\">0542b23</span><p class=\"lg\">我等於佛法，<caesura/>皆生欣樂心。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0542b24\">0542b24</span><p class=\"lg\">發趣於菩提，<caesura/>利樂眾生類，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0542b25\">0542b25</span><p class=\"lg\">以善而養命，<caesura/>覺慧自安心。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0542b26\">0542b26</span><p class=\"lg\">憐愍諸眾生，<caesura/>願當成佛道，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0542b27\">0542b27</span><p class=\"lg\">我等皆已發，<caesura/>無上菩提心。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0542b28\">0542b28</span><p class=\"lg\">金色相莊嚴，<caesura/>照明於世界，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0542b29\">0542b29</span><p class=\"lg\">樂菩提心者，<caesura/>當得如來身。</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0542c01\">0542c01</span><p class=\"lg\">大心菩提心，<caesura/>諸心中最上，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0542c02\">0542c02</span><p class=\"lg\">解脫一切縛，<caesura/>具足諸功德。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0542c03\">0542c03</span><p class=\"lg\">少福諸眾生，<caesura/>於此無欣樂，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0542c04\">0542c04</span><p class=\"lg\">不觀生死過，<caesura/>不樂菩提心。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0542c05\">0542c05</span><p class=\"lg\">菩提心功德，<caesura/>若有色方分，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0542c06\">0542c06</span><p class=\"lg\">周遍虛空界，<caesura/>無能容受者？</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0542c07\">0542c07</span><p class=\"lg\">恒河沙數等，<caesura/>諸佛剎土中，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0542c08\">0542c08</span><p class=\"lg\">假使布珍寶，<caesura/>供養於諸佛。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0542c09\">0542c09</span><p class=\"lg\">有能一合掌，<caesura/>迴向菩提心，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0542c10\">0542c10</span><p class=\"lg\">其福過於彼，<caesura/>邊際不可得。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0542c11\">0542c11</span><p class=\"lg\">非唯供養福，<caesura/>餘福亦復然，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0542c12\">0542c12</span><p class=\"lg\">如是菩提心，<caesura/>最勝仙所說。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0542c13\">0542c13</span><p class=\"lg\">菩提心最勝，<caesura/>如阿伽陀藥，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0542c14\">0542c14</span><p class=\"lg\">能除一切病，<caesura/>與一切安樂。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0542c15\">0542c15</span><p class=\"lg\">我見諸眾生，<caesura/>三火所熱惱，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0542c16\">0542c16</span><p class=\"lg\">智者無量劫，<caesura/>勤苦常修習。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0542c17\">0542c17</span><p class=\"lg\">如醫王勇猛，<caesura/>具足菩提行，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0542c18\">0542c18</span><p class=\"lg\">救拔<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0542002\">眾生苦＝苦眾生【聖】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0542002\">眾生苦【大】，苦眾生【聖】</span><app n=\"0542002\"><p class=\"lg\">眾生苦</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【聖】\">苦眾生</rdg></app>，<caesura/>永離諸憂惱。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0542c19\">0542c19</span><p class=\"lg\">於一切生處，<caesura/>終不捨是心，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0542c20\">0542c20</span><p class=\"lg\">勤修諸行願，<caesura/>勇猛求佛法。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0542c21\">0542c21</span><p class=\"lg\">我等得善利，<caesura/>我等心欣樂，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0542c22\">0542c22</span><p class=\"lg\">今遇釋師子，<caesura/>當得如來身。」</p></lg>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0542c23\">0542c23</span><p>爾時世尊即便微笑，從其面門放種種光，青\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0542c24\">0542c24</span>黃赤白紅紫<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0542003\">頗黎＝玻<g ref=\"#CB00224\"/>【明】，頗梨【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0542003\">頗黎【大】，玻<g ref=\"#CB00224\"/>【明】，頗梨【宮】</span><app n=\"0542003\"><p class=\"lg\">頗黎</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【明】\">玻<g ref=\"#CB00224\"/></rdg><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宮】\">頗梨</rdg></app>，照於無量無邊世界，乃\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0542c25\">0542c25</span>至梵世日月威光皆悉隱蔽，還遶三匝從佛\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0542c26\">0542c26</span>頂入。爾時尊者阿難即從座起，偏袒右肩右\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0542c27\">0542c27</span>膝著地，合掌向佛<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0542004\">白＝曰【宋】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0542004\">白【大】，曰【宋】</span><app n=\"0542004\"><p class=\"lg\">白</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】\">曰</rdg></app>言：「世尊！有何因緣現\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0542c28\">0542c28</span>此微笑？如佛所現，非無因緣。」即於佛前而\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0542c29\">0542c29</span>說偈言：</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0543a01\">0543a01</span><p class=\"lg\"><p class=\"lg\">「諸佛最上之導師，<caesura/>不以無因現微笑，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0543a02\">0543a02</span><p class=\"lg\">哀<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0543001\">愍＝慜【宋】【元】【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0543001\">愍【大】，慜【宋】【元】【宮】</span><app n=\"0543001\"><p class=\"lg\">愍</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【宮】\">慜</rdg></app>世間利益者，<caesura/>願說所為之因緣。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0543a03\">0543a03</span><p class=\"lg\">貧乏眾生無法財，<caesura/>應說最上大乘施，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0543a04\">0543a04</span><p class=\"lg\">能作世間盲冥眼，<caesura/>願說微笑之因緣。」</p></lg>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0543a05\">0543a05</span><p>於時世尊告阿難曰：「汝見此五百長者今於\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0543a06\">0543a06</span>我所發阿耨多羅三藐三菩提心不？」</p><p>阿難白\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0543a07\">0543a07</span>言：「唯然已見。」</p><p>佛告阿難：「此五百長者，已於\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0543a08\">0543a08</span>往昔百千億那由他諸佛所，承事供養種諸\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0543a09\">0543a09</span>善根，今聞是法得無生忍。此諸長者，從是\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0543a10\">0543a10</span>已後不生惡趣，於人天中常受快樂。復於來\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0543a11\">0543a11</span>世彌勒佛所，供養恭敬尊重讚歎。及賢劫中\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0543a12\">0543a12</span>一切諸佛，悉皆承事恭敬供養，於諸佛所聽\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0543a13\">0543a13</span>聞正法，受持讀誦為他廣說。過二十五劫，各\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0543a14\">0543a14</span>於諸佛剎中成無上菩提，皆同一字號勝蓮\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0543a15\">0543a15</span>花藏如來、應、正等覺。」</p><p>爾時尊者阿難白佛言：\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0543a16\">0543a16</span>「世尊！希有世尊！希有善逝！當何名此廣大\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0543a17\">0543a17</span>法門？云何奉持？」</p><p>佛告阿難：「是法門名『菩薩\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0543a18\">0543a18</span>瑜伽師地』，亦名『勇猛授長者所問』，如是名號\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0543a19\">0543a19</span>汝當受持。」</p><p>佛說此經已，尊者阿難及諸比\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0543a20\">0543a20</span>丘，五百長者、諸菩薩眾，天、人、阿修羅等，聞\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0543a21\">0543a21</span>佛所說，皆大歡喜，信受奉行。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0543a22\">0543a22</span><cb:juan n=\"096\" fun=\"close\"><cb:jhead><title>大寶積經</title>卷第九十六<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0543002\">光明皇后願文【聖】</span></cb:jhead></cb:juan></cb:div>\r\n</body>"
    }
  ],
  "version": "CBReader 2X v0.9.9 2026-01-21"
}